摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Local-first MCP App for scientific figures. Import, review, and publish a global library on disk; reuse exact templates in Pi, DeepSeek Harness (dsh), Claude, Codex, Cursor, and Wisp.","id":"gh:1315650270","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"ScientificFigureLibrary","slug":"xuzhougeng/ScientificFigureLibrary","topics":["ai-agents","claude","claude-science","data-visualization","deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","figure-library","figure-templates","local-first","mcp","mcp-app","model-context-protocol","pi","pi-package","publication-figures","reproducible-research","scientific-figures","scientific-visualization","wisp-science"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Local-first MCP App for scientific figures. Import, review, and publish a global library on disk; re"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"use exact templates in Pi, DeepSeek Harness (dsh), Claude, Codex, Cursor, and Wisp."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# Scientific Figure Library"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"Website ·\n简体中文 ·\nQuickstart ·\nUser Guide (online) ·\nProtocol ·\nReleases ·\nWisp Science"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"Scientific Figure Library (SFL) is a **local-first MCP server and MCP App** for\n**your scientific fi"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"gures**. You import a figure and its code, review them,\npublish an immutable Release to **one global"},{"id":"p4s3","text":" Library on your machine**, then\nreuse that exact template across projects in **Claude Science**, **"},{"id":"p4s4","text":"Wisp Science**,\n**Codex**, **Cursor**, **Pi**, **dsh**, and other stdio MCP hosts."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"The Library stays on disk you choose. Nothing is copied into every project\nuntil you confirm a mater"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"ialization. The server does **not** execute plotting\ncode and does not contain a second model: the h"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"ost agent inspects files; SFL\nhashes, versions, gates, and publishes them."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"The default retrieval order is **Local Published → FigureYa → Open Figure\nModules → enabled dynamic "},{"id":"p6s2","text":"personal Providers**. The bundled Community snapshot\nis retained for explicit compatibility, but is "},{"id":"p6s3","text":"frozen and excluded from default\nsearch (`includeInDefaultSearch: false`). The source of truth for y"},{"id":"p6s4","text":"our own\nfigures is always **Local Published**."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"A bundled extra catalog may currently contain zero releases after an authorized\nredaction; that is a"},{"id":"p7s2","text":" healthy empty source, not a failure, and default search\ncontinues across other providers."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"Search your local published library in the MCP App, confirm one exact template, then materialize it "},{"id":"p8s2","text":"al published library in the MCP App, confirm one exact template, then materialize it into a project."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## Local client preview"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"Separate native macOS Apple Silicon and Intel DMGs, a per-user Windows installer, plus Windows and L"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"inux ZIPs with bundled Node, are available through the local-client release workflow. Both bundled-N"},{"id":"p10s3","text":"ode and `no-node` editions (requiring installed Node.js 22+) omit gallery images and download previe"},{"id":"p10s4","text":"ws on demand. See installation and preview limitations. The macOS preview is ad-hoc signed and is no"},{"id":"p10s5","text":". See installation and preview limitations. The macOS preview is ad-hoc signed and is not notarized."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"## Install with a coding agent"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"Node.js 22+ is required. Do not execute user plotting code. After install, bind\none global Library d"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"irectory on disk; if `setup_required`, also bind a Local\nworkspace before searching."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"### Pi"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"Install the published npm package. Do not `pi install` a GitHub URL or git\nclone: the repository doe"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"s not contain `dist/`, so MCP cannot start."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"Restart Pi. The package loads the `figure-library` Skill and registers the\nstdio MCP server through "},{"id":"p16s2","text":"pi-mcp-adapter. If you already copied a local SFL app\nMCP config into `~/.config/mcp/mcp.json` or `."},{"id":"p16s3","text":"mcp.json`, skip\n`pi install npm:scientific-figure-library` — that duplicates tools."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"Paste this request:"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"### DeepSeek Harness (dsh)"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"`--profile` is required. Use `web` unless you run another profile."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"Restart the profile (`dsh --profile web` or `dsh web`). The bundle registers\nthe Skill and mounts `@"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"deepseek-ai/dsh-mcp-client` against this package. If you\nalready added a dsh MCP client row for a lo"},{"id":"p22s3","text":"cal SFL app, do not also run\n`dsh plugin add scientific-figure-library`."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"Paste this request:"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"### Claude, Codex, Cursor, Wisp, or another stdio host"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"Give the agent this repository and the following request:"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"Manual steps: docs/QUICKSTART.md."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"## What is included"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"- **Local Published library** — one user-selected directory, shared across\nprojects and hosts\n- Dire"},{"id":"p30s2","text":"ct **image + code intake**, review gates, immutable Revisions and Releases\n- MCP App gallery: browse"},{"id":"p30s3","text":", exact preview, user confirmation\n- Search, describe, preview, then **materialize** an exact confir"},{"id":"p30s4","text":"med template\n- Portable backup / restore / fork of the Library\n- Optional extra search providers; th"},{"id":"p30s5","text":"ey do not replace local review\n- **Open Figure Modules** — the same `io.github.jarxunlai.personal-fi"},{"id":"p30s6","text":"gures`\nProvider. A bundled snapshot is only the offline bootstrap. After install,\nSFL asynchronously"},{"id":"p30s7","text":" checks a signed GitHub feed and atomically switches the\nlocal Catalog overlay. Ordinary template up"},{"id":"p30s8","text":"dates no longer require\nrepackaging the plugin. Complete module ZIPs are still fetched only for one\n"},{"id":"p30s9","text":"exact selected materialization."},{"id":"p31s1","text":"## Bundled figure workflow"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"The host plugin ZIPs and the npm package used by Pi and dsh include one core figure-library Skill wi"},{"id":"p32s2","text":"th on-demand\ndescription, script-organization and style references. Ordinary MCP hosts can\nread the "},{"id":"p32s3","text":"same guidance with `figure_library_get_skill`, browse thumbnails with\n`figure_library_get_candidate_"},{"id":"p32s4","text":"images` or resource URIs, and paginate with\n`figure_library_search_page`. The MCP App is optional. A"},{"id":"p32s5","text":"pproved R/Python runtimes and host execution/image tools\nare still required when the user asks to dr"},{"id":"p32s6","text":"oved R/Python runtimes and host execution/image tools\nare still required when the user asks to draw."},{"id":"p33s1","text":"Template details render safe Markdown for the requirement, biological use\ncases and data profile, wi"},{"id":"p33s2","text":"th actual input/code/package lists visible.\nTechnical identities and validation state are available "},{"id":"p33s3","text":"in a collapsed area.\nHistorical Local Published/OFM entries remain readable; this update does not\nre"},{"id":"p33s4","text":"write their content or the bundled FigureYa catalog."},{"id":"p34s1","text":"## First success"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"If the local library is empty, import a figure/code pair, review it, and\npublish a Release before se"},{"id":"p36s2","text":"arching. Full contract: docs/PROTOCOL.md."},{"id":"p37s1","text":"## Develop from source"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"Requires Node.js 22+:"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"Pull requests run tests, type checking, build and MCP smoke across Linux, Windows\nand macOS. See bas"},{"id":"p39s2","text":"ic CI for the matrix and merge-check setup.\nPushing a stable `vX.Y.Z` tag packages local clients, ho"},{"id":"p39s3","text":"st plugins, the npm\ntarball and the Wisp update feed, then uploads them to the GitHub Release.\n[该节后续"},{"id":"p39s4","text":"plugins, the npm\ntarball and the Wisp update feed, then uploads them to the GitHub Release.\n[该节后续省略]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
